<title>USA: GM November US total car sales fall 22.5 pct.</title>
<headline>GM November US total car sales fall 22.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DETROIT 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>General Motors Corp</p>
<p>			Nov 1-30, 1996     Nov 1-30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Total Car		179,150	   231,052	    -22.5</p>
<p> Total Truck	    157,665	   151,320	     +4.2</p>
<p> Total Vehicle	  336,815	   382,372	    -11.9</p>
<p>		  Jan 1-Nov 30, 1996 Jan 1-Nov 30, 1995 *Pct Chng</p>
<p> Total Car	    2,595,794	 2,738,742	     -5.9</p>
<p> Total Truck	  1,851,353	 1,754,774	     +4.8</p>
<p> Total Vehicle	4,447,147	 4,493,516	     -1.7</p>
<p>* Pct change based on daily selling rate. Sale days 25 in latest month vs 25, 283 for year to date vs 281 in year ago.</p>
</text>
